# This repository tracks the TOOL'S CODE ONLY.
#
# Deliberately NOT version-controlled: the reference corpus (the agencies' own
# copyrighted published rationales), the knowledge base, case data under Companies/,
# generated workbooks/PDFs, and caches. The project folder is zipped and emailed with
# deliverables, so confidential and third-party material must stay out of git history.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then re-include only the code paths. This is
# a whitelist on purpose - a new top-level data folder is excluded by default, never
# committed by accident.

/*

# --- re-included: the tool's own code and config ---
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/UNIFIED_RATING_GUIDE.md
!/webapp/
!/tools/
!/.claude/

# --- within the tracked trees, still drop caches, machine-local prefs, logs and secrets ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
/webapp/ui_prefs.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
